window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When a young girl is kidnapped from the Copperfield Academy, Asha receives a visit from her parents—the wealthiest couple in the realm.</b><br> <br> Their plea sounds simple—find their daughter at any cost—but comes with a host of difficulties the Green Witch could never dream of (and a large payday if she's successful).<br> <br> When Mercury is adopted from Woodhaven Children's Home, her new life seems more incredible than she could ever imagine...until things don't quite add up.<br> <br> As Asha pursues lead after lead in a quest to find the rich couple's missing daughter, what she discovers shakes her to her core.<br> <br> With the fate of the realm hanging on her shoulders, and a sinister presence lurking in the background behind it all, Asha and her rag-tag group of friends will travel to places they've never imagined and see things out of their worst nightmares....</p> <p>With more twists and turns than you can shake a wand at, this is a dark magic mystery with humor, adventure, and a whole lot of heart.<br> <br> Fans of Patricia Briggs and Ilona Andrews will burn through this brand new addictive urban fantasy series.<br> <br> Stay up all night with <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author and Kindle All-Star JT Lawrence.</p>"; 
